## What CI actually covers

{{CI_COVERAGE}}

Read this off the workflow, not off memory. A doc's claim about what CI runs goes stale the moment
the workflow changes, and nothing tells you it has.

## The obligation

**Never disable, skip, or delete a test to make a diff clean.** If one genuinely must go, the reason
goes in the change that removes it, and an unexplained removal is a blocker at review.
